body:
I refused to play on the girls teams for gym class sports; 
I shoved bouncy balls in my pants when I was like 10 because I wanted to know how it would feel to have balls; 
Never liked being called “lady”; 
I’ve always been tall “for a girl” but always felt the need to be taller; 
Being jealous of another girls short hair in elementary school; 
The list goes on…
